{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちはるーむへようこそ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日フォルダを漁っていたら、\n楽しそうな写真見つけたよ(﹡ˆ ˆ﹡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/12/03/9138785/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/12/03/9138785/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/12/03/9138785/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"爆笑するなーちゃんと、私。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして右下にいるのはまあや！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあやが面白かったのかな( ◦˙ ˙◦ )？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあやが可愛かったのかな( ◦˙ ˙◦ )？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一年半以上前の写真！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アルバム握手会だから、\nみんなそれぞれ色んな衣装着てる◎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お揃いの衣装が私たちは多いから\n色んな衣装を着ている子が集まると\n少し面白い！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3人とも、なんの曲の衣装を着ているか\n皆さん分かりますか？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちょっとしか写ってないし、\nこれが分かった方いたら凄いと思う！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"回答待ってます(_ _).｡o♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"----------------------------♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日配信された、「のぎ天2」\n#13を見てくださった方いますか？\\( ˆ ˆ )/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんと、私がMCを務めました...！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"滅多にやらない、私のMCが\nどんな感じなのか知りたい方は是非◎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも全然できなかったからな〜...\n見られるのも少し恥ずかしいな〜...笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/12/03/9138785/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(私だけ顔ボケた...ピント...)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなの私服姿も要チェック！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"----------------------------♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"♬ ChihaMusic"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「Treasure」Bruno Marsさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"家族で大好きなBruno Marsさん！\n今日、最新アルバムも買ってきました♪\n車で沢山リピートします！\nこの曲は宝物についての話。\n片思いしている彼女が宝物だという歌。\n\"Treasure, that is what you are\nHoney you're my golden star\"の部分が好き！\nずっと聞いていたいし、\nずっと歌っていたい。\n洋楽も大好きなんです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"毎日があっという間に過ぎていく！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もう来週にはライブだなんて...\n驚きだよ〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いいもの見せられるように\n今のうちに沢山準備しなきゃ◎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみ〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"斎藤ちはる"}],"source":"archive"}